{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09988","headline":"送金文学还日东 · 沈颂","name":"送金文学还日东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家东海东，君去因秋风。\n漫漫指乡路，悠悠如梦中。\n烟雾积孤岛，波涛连太空。\n冒险当不惧，皇恩措尔躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈颂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}